# Reports directory

Machine-readable agent layer outputs live here:

- `latest-agent-report.json` — last round structured report
- `tool_probe_report.json` — tool capability probe
- `gate_result.json` — agent gate summary
- `user_view_test.json` — user-view smoke results
- `agent_audit_log.jsonl` — append-only audit trail

Do not commit sensitive API outputs or real translation content.
